{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011ChA6jFy1rj2Xce5zGRAXd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I can't confirm this lab, and I don't know who teaches it.\n\n- **The timetable has no Saturday slots.** The campus timetable tool only covers Monday to Friday and says there are no weekend classes. A Saturday 2pm lab in LAB-9 can't be on your official timetable.\n- **I couldn't check the weekdays either.** I tried to look up CSE-A's Monday to Friday timetable to see if Quantum Computing shows up on another day. Those lookups were blocked because the timetable tool hasn't been given permission yet.\n\nI won't name a teacher or confirm the lab without a record behind it. The timetable is also what the office forgot to update, so it couldn't settle this anyway. The best people to ask are the department office or the course coordinator. They can confirm the lab exists, who the instructor is, and get it added to the official sheet.\n\nIf you allow the timetable tool, I can check CSE-A's weekday classes for any Quantum Computing entry and its instructor."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1044,"cache_read_input_tokens":35230,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1044},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5cd928ac-9a67-4c0b-8e43-59167639170d","uuid":"0e964d7e-5453-40a6-8de6-6ec1fcfe00ff","timestamp":"2026-11-18T08:44:53.220Z","request_id":"req_011ChA6jFkciLhUaiPcdM4sE"}
